  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おーおーおー、
おめぇら、待たせただ。
ちーっと、ヤボ用があっただーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh~oh~oh~. I did keep ya waiting,
didn't I? Just had a few errands
what needed running.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ううん、大丈夫ですよ、
アルベルトさん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, that's alright, Albert.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソ。
平気、平気！
みーんな待ってたから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, It's all fine! We just
aaallll waited here, together.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なーんか、気持ち悪い空気だよ。
おい！　ハゲぼうず！
こりゃ、どういうことだ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've got a kind of creepin' feeling
from ya just now... Oi, numbskull!
What's that all about!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………、
し、知らねぇよ。
お前が何してたかなんて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I-I don't know anything.
I didn't see anything you
did, or, uh, anything like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shhh...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう、&lt;Dio&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>C'mon, &lt;Dio&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>や、やべっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sh-Shit...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あーん？
なんだかよくわらんが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? I don't really get it, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おらは、ちっと運動したもんで
喉を潤しに馴染みの店に
行っただよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>All I did was get a little exercise,
then stop by my favorite little
shop and wet my whistle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それが、どうかしただか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there something the
matter with that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……、
運動をしたかラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmmm... So you
did some exercise...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>馴染みのお店で……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And went to your favorite
little shop, and...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クルール！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Couleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274972</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、じゃ、そういう事で、
いいんじゃないかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, anyway, let's
just leave it at that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うんうん、そうだね！
よし、行こう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, let's do that!
Alright, time to go!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>クッルール！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Colleuru!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なーんか、わっかんねぇが
損はしてねぇようだから
放っておくだかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I still don't get it, but it doesn't seem
like there's any harm in me not
knowin', so I guess I'll leave it be.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>んなもん、いらんだーよ！
おらはおらで、おらだけだ！
そんなもんに縛られないだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the hell would I need this for!?
I'm just me, bein' me, just as I am!
Don't go saddlin' me with all that!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へっ！
わかりゃーいいだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hah! Well, if ya
got it, then good!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
